              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جنایت (jenâyat) — \"a serious crime, a felony\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "این جنایت همه شهر را شوکه کرد. In jenâyat hame-ye shahr râ shoke kard. This crime shocked the whole city."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For violent crimes. jenâyatkâr \"a criminal\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "jenâyat is borrowed from Arabic jināya, \"crime\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
