              "text": "قاتل (qâtel) — \"a murderer, a killer\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پلیس هنوز قاتل را پیدا نکرده است. Polis hanuz qâtel râ peydâ nakarde ast. The police have not found the murderer yet."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Same Arabic root as qatl: qâtel is \"the one who kills\". Plural qâtelân."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "qâtel is borrowed from Arabic qātil, \"killer\" (EtymDB), the active participle of the same root as qatl."
            }
          ]
        },
