            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "یک سگ بزرگ به پسر حمله کرد. Yek sag-e bozorg be pesar hamle kard. A big dog attacked the boy."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The one attacked takes be. Present hamle mikonad. Hamle-ye qalbi \"a heart attack\"."
            }
          ]
        },
