              "text": "اسلحه (aslahe) — \"a weapon, a gun\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مرد اسلحه نداشت. Mard aslahe nadâsht. The man did not have a weapon."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An Arabic plural in origin, used as a singular in Persian. Aslahe-ye sard is a knife or blade."
            }
          ]
        },
